{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1064001/block/singleImage/3268367/df/01M7HFA70B71SV58PXW1DN0CGJ.jpeg?updatedAt=1794809375\"/><figcaption>BL劇《煙灰》CP香港見面會合體。</figcaption></figure><p>憑 BL 劇《煙灰》人氣急升的億軒（ Kingston ）與彭梓燁（ Leo ），攜手於香港舉辦「億軒 x 彭梓燁『一見鍾情 THE FIRST 』 LEOKING 2026 FAN MEETING IN HONGKONG 」。兩人首度在港合體開騷，吸引大批劇迷與粉絲到場支持。兩人全晚傾力演出，不僅接連獻唱多首金曲並大跳熱辣雙人舞，更在互動環節大派「高甜售後福利」，多次親密貼近及 kiss ，引得現場粉絲嗌破喉嚨，尖叫聲幾乎掀翻場館，完場後大會更驚喜預告落實舉行澳門站見面會！</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:35:02.428255+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":258,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T07:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T08:48:39.302539+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T08:28:27.330880+00:00","content_hash":"d5f3439a341b32204d858a773c242042a395ac6f9e3ea044ae6a8882e021f2cb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T08:35:02.428255+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}